<title>UK: NIB sets 14 billion peseta 10-year structured bond.</title>
<headline>NIB sets 14 billion peseta 10-year structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following structured bond was announced by lead manager Banco Bilbao Vizcaya.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDIC INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT     14 BLN ESP   COUPON    *7.70	MATURITY    02.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.45    PAY DATE    02.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES     *PAYS 15.50 PCT MINUS ONE-YEAR LIBOR IN YRS 6-10.</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     DENOMS (K)  100</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
